          "@language": "fa"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Dr. Saeed Ghezelbash is the sole treating physician and sole clinical service provider at Dr. Saeed Ghezelbash Aesthetic Clinic, unless a specific service node explicitly states otherwise.",
