      "description": "Adds dated third-party reputation/patient-perception observations and corroborated skill terms. Corrects the Google Places userRatingCount mapping to schema:ratingCount only; no Google reviewCount value is asserted from userRatingCount. External directory ratings are kept as provenance-aware observations rather than copied to Person.aggregateRating.",
