      "description": "Additive v13 upgrade: systematic EvidenceSource-to-entity inverse links; Web Annotation indexing; cross-source identity and practice convergence bundles; explicit Claim provenance bundles; credential evidence bundles; direct authoredWork/researchOutput navigation; direct Person-to-Role navigation; structured reification of existing award strings; external reputation dataset expansion to existing Google Maps/Balad observations; platform-specific and cross-platform reputation convergence collections; clinical/reputation observation typing; and additional SHACL authority/connectivity constraints. No original factual node is removed."
    },
